        "content": "# Metric Contract\n\nThis dashboard assumes Prometheus metrics following these conventions:\n\n- `${metric_prefix}_requests_total{job,provider,route,model,status,cache_hit,connection_reused}`\n- `${metric_prefix}_upstream_requests_total{job,provider,route,model,status}`\n- `${metric_prefix}_inflight_requests{job,provider,route,model}`\n- `${metric_prefix}_input_tokens_total{job,provider,route,model}`\n- `${metric_prefix}_output_tokens_total{job,provider,route,model}`\n- `${metric_prefix}_cached_tokens_total{job,provider,route,model}`\n- `${metric_prefix}_ttft_seconds_bucket`\n- `${metric_prefix}_request_duration_seconds_bucket`\n- `${metric_prefix}_prompt_build_seconds_bucket`\n- `${metric_prefix}_upstream_connect_seconds_bucket`\n- `${metric_prefix}_upstream_wait_seconds_bucket`\n- `${metric_prefix}_proxy_flush_seconds_bucket`\n\nRecommended label set for debugging TTFT: `provider`, `model`, `route`, `region`, `status`, `cache_hit`, `connection_reused`, `cold_start`.\n\nIf your metric names differ, only change the `metric_prefix` variable or the PromQL expressions.",
